# HAPI HL7v2 fixtures keep their stored bytes exactly (see README "Provenance"): the verbatim
# ones match upstream, and the de-identified ones keep upstream's line endings. Never let EOL
# normalization touch them, or the verbatim files drift from upstream and the MPL-2.0
# "unmodified" basis no longer holds. -text = store/checkout exactly as-is.
*.hl7 -text
*.txt -text
